cff-version: 2.0.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RapidCaseReport"
abstract: "RapidCaseReport is a lightweight R/Shiny tool for rapid, standardized data collection and reporting of suspected cases or health-related rumours. It captures a minimal set of essential variables to support early, local-level surveillance and enables simple CSV exports for downstream analysis."
